Z||000000||Zoom88||11-19-2001||12:22 PM||||My question is are all Year Fiero v6 injectors the same. And interchangeable?<BR>Ok one more question, are the stock injectors 19# .<BR>  Thanks for the info.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||11-19-2001||12:45 PM||||All Fiero V-6 injectors are the same......I think they are more like 16 or 17 lbs., but I'm not sure. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||11-19-2001||02:38 PM||||All the 2.8L Fiero's used the same pin-type injectors. If you want to change them out, Get a set for a 3.1L. These are the disc-type. They have a better spray pattern and they don't foul as easily as a pin-type injector. The have the same flow/pound rate as the Fiero 2.8L injectors. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||rodmcneill||11-19-2001||02:49 PM||||I thought I had read that the 88 GT had different injectors from previous years,less prone to plugging.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fformula88||11-19-2001||02:53 PM||||There is something about imrovements made to the 88 Injectors in the 1988 Press kit Pontiac handed out.  I cannot remember the exact changes, and am at work and cannot check right now.  They did claim the design was less prone to clogging.  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||11-19-2001||06:18 PM||||In '88 they went to the disc type, Multec I believe.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000006||watts||11-19-2001||08:11 PM||||I've found that not all the 88's got the disc style!  Guess who's 88 got the pintle ones.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I also found some other later model Pontiac injectors on ebay, and they were pintle as well!  Arghgghh!!<P>I did find some later model Caddy ones that were used on the 300cid something or other, and they looked (??) like ours, and they are disc style.  No idea on the flow rate though - they could be 19lb ones which will choke out a stock engine.<BR><P>------------------<BR>87/88 V6 5spd Notchback Hybrid<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/watts_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
